00:18:28.541 --> 00:18:31.119
Hey!

00:18:31.143 --> 00:18:36.047
Haven't we gone too far? He's stopped moving.

00:18:38.384 --> 00:18:40.546
Hey...

00:18:43.823 --> 00:18:49.071
Come to think of it, last night,
she was wearing my clothes.

00:18:49.095 --> 00:18:51.587
That means at the time...

00:18:56.869 --> 00:18:59.548
Shit.

00:18:59.572 --> 00:19:01.383
What the hell?

00:19:01.407 --> 00:19:03.218
What's the matter?

00:19:03.242 --> 00:19:06.007
He's got a hard-on.

00:19:08.281 --> 00:19:11.226
Wait! This feeling!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.096
I think it's starting to work!

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:19.320
You got the wrong idea, kid!
I'll fucking kill you!

00:19:22.795 --> 00:19:25.841
I won't pay you.

00:19:25.865 --> 00:19:27.376
What did you say?

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:29.344
Are you that stupid?

00:19:29.368 --> 00:19:32.347
Tachibana, it's okay to kill him!

00:19:32.371 --> 00:19:35.350
Why, you...

00:19:35.374 --> 00:19:39.277
I could crush this arm!

00:19:41.113 --> 00:19:43.525
Should I crush it?

00:19:43.549 --> 00:19:48.897
What are you doing, Tachibana?
I said you could get rid of him.

00:19:48.921 --> 00:19:52.551
Damn... Let go!

00:20:00.633 --> 00:20:02.577
You dumb kid!

00:20:02.601 --> 00:20:05.332
Don't fuck with me!

00:20:23.556 --> 00:20:27.602
You, the one who isn't a punk.

00:20:27.626 --> 00:20:29.822
Go on home.

00:20:34.333 --> 00:20:37.045
What the hell happened?

00:20:37.069 --> 00:20:39.681
Damn it!

00:20:39.705 --> 00:20:43.573
My hands won't stop shaking!

00:21:08.501 --> 00:21:10.196
No way!

00:21:11.971 --> 00:21:13.962
Is this for real?

00:21:22.815 --> 00:21:29.949
We all start out as pure and innocent babes

00:21:34.427 --> 00:21:41.458
Even if you taste the bitter fruit,
don't be discouraged, walk straight

00:21:46.005 --> 00:21:54.005
I know it's in the past, but the rain still stings

00:22:00.119 --> 00:22:02.364
I'm lonely as floating ice

00:22:02.388 --> 00:22:07.202
I kiss your thin finger

00:22:07.226 --> 00:22:13.909
And remember you crying

00:22:13.933 --> 00:22:18.780
Even if this is the end

00:22:18.804 --> 00:22:23.685
I won't forget your last kiss

00:22:23.709 --> 00:22:31.709
I won't forget... I won't forget...

00:22:35.621 --> 00:22:38.621
I won't forget his kiss
